     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\">All,</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\">I am trying to figure out how to let objects reenter the simulation.</span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\">For example, in the classic bank tutorial, customers show up and then leave.</span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\">What if I wanted the customers to come back. For example</span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\">&quot;Customer 1 enters&quot;</span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\">&quot;Customer 2 enters&quot;</span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\">&quot;Customer 1 leaves&quot;</span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\">&quot;Customer 3 enters&quot;</span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\">&quot;Customer 1 reenters&quot;</span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\">...</span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\">...</span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\">and run this until a certain time.</span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\">As it stands now, my objects come and go and that is the end of the simulation.</span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\">Best,</span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.800000190734863px\">Michael</span></div></div>"
